KG42.register("slice-clusters-c0ee9bfcec2b125e53ca3511",{"id":"32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v142-d-K002","paper":"32-wholesale_prosumer_storage","title":"STEP two-stage joint trading, scenario fulfillment, and community net-cost allocation","source_pointer":"/clusters/127","node_ids":["COMP-38f1b9199b3ea8cd","COMP-b3f649e90c1f17b9","COMP-970463b73869ba14","COMP-8194bc76303bef38","COMP-739917e3869e45a6","COMP-374de966ac2aa057"],"rule_refs":["32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R002","32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R007","32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R008","32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R009","32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R010","32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R001","32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R004"],"visible_rule_refs":["32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R002","32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R007","32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R008","32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R009","32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R010","32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R001","32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R004"],"suppressed_rule_refs":[],"edges":[{"global_edge_id":"S-06f12b2e42dcb123","source":"COMP-38f1b9199b3ea8cd","target":"COMP-b3f649e90c1f17b9","type":"links","assertion_ids":["32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R007::E::v141-c-R007-E001"],"rule_refs":["32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R007"],"internal":false},{"global_edge_id":"S-8d098cb6627f01f8","source":"COMP-38f1b9199b3ea8cd","target":"COMP-970463b73869ba14","type":"links","assertion_ids":["32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R008::E::v141-c-R008-E001"],"rule_refs":["32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R008"],"internal":false},{"global_edge_id":"S-4d9c249197b6a5f9","source":"COMP-b3f649e90c1f17b9","target":"COMP-8194bc76303bef38","type":"implies","assertion_ids":["32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R009::E::v141-c-R009-E001"],"rule_refs":["32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R009"],"internal":false},{"global_edge_id":"S-bff6dfc551325446","source":"COMP-38f1b9199b3ea8cd","target":"COMP-8194bc76303bef38","type":"links","assertion_ids":["32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R009::E::v141-c-R009-E002"],"rule_refs":["32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R009"],"internal":false},{"global_edge_id":"S-47b7c7aeb0343028","source":"COMP-739917e3869e45a6","target":"COMP-8194bc76303bef38","type":"conditional_on","assertion_ids":["32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R010::E::v141-c-R010-E001"],"rule_refs":["32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R010"],"internal":false}],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"interface_annotations":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-L01","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C001","v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e03","v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g01-e07"],"rationale":"The collective wholesale participation permission and the specific day-ahead bidding activity are complementary; the participation permission itself does not mean that a supply bid must be submitted in all circumstances."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-L02","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C001","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g02-e08"],"rationale":"The same source explicitly assigns automatic bidding based on community information to STEP and limits it to a computational interface that does not hold electricity; this is a correspondence between responsibility and activity."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-L03","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C003"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C001","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e13","v141-b-g02-e03","v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g02-e30"],"rationale":"STEP's community expected cost objective is concretely carried by the resource allocation optimization of the same framework; other independent constraints are not merged because of the common agent."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-L04","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C002","v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C003"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C004","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C002","v141-c-R008::x::x_F_DA"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e03","v141-b-g01-e07","v141-b-g02-e16","v141-b-g02-e18","v141-b-g03-E03","v141-b-g03-E04"],"rationale":"Day-ahead bidding and allocation are both based on forecasts and must consider supply-demand security in each scenario. Here only the planning and fulfillment functions are associated, and F_DA is not identified as a bid quantity that has not yet been declared."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-L05","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R009","kind":"alternative_representation","from_refs":["v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C003"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g03-E03"],"rationale":"The two records come from the same statement on fulfillment of day-ahead commitments and appear respectively as a bidding-side obligation and an execution-side logical relation; the alternative expressions are retained and not counted as an additional obligation."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-L06","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R009","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C002","v141-c-R008::x::x_G_ID"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C010"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e12","v141-b-g02-e18"],"rationale":"Intraday electricity purchase is a supply-demand remediation option described by the source and appears on the second-stage supply side; this correspondence does not prove that the optimization has strictly implemented the trigger conditions of using P2P and energy storage first."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-L07","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R009","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C007","v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C008","v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C009"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R008::x::x_F_DA","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C007","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e07","v141-b-g02-e10","v141-b-g02-e16","v141-b-g02-e18","v141-b-g03-E02"],"rationale":"The day-ahead feed-in permission, the intraday export prohibition, and the feed-in source restriction define the trading scope of the allocation model; the existing quantity definitions are not yet sufficient to prove that the source restriction has been implemented mathematically."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-L08","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::v141-c-R001-X","v141-c-R001::x::v141-c-R001-I","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R008::x::x_X_DA","v141-c-R008::x::x_X_ID","v141-c-R008::x::x_I_DA","v141-c-R008::x::x_I_ID"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e15","v141-b-g02-e16","v141-b-g02-e18","v141-b-g02-e19","v141-b-g02-e21","v141-b-g02-e23","v141-b-g02-e24"],"rationale":"The aggregate balance and stage-specific allocation involve the same community P2P activity and constitute a quantity interface to be closed; the source does not specify the bridge, and the aggregate quantity cannot be directly equated with the sum of DA and ID quantities."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-L09","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R010","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R008::x::x_G_DA","v141-c-R008::x::x_F_DA","v141-c-R008::x::x_G_ID"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R010::x::v141-c-R010-x001","v141-c-R010::x::v141-c-R010-x002","v141-c-R010::x::v141-c-R010-x003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e21","v141-b-g02-e31","v141-b-g02-e32"],"rationale":"On the allocation side, day-ahead electricity purchase, day-ahead feed-in, and intraday electricity purchase are respectively the same model transaction quantities used in cost accounting, while their local functional roles remain separate."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-L10","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R010","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C003"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R010::phi::v141-c-R010-C003","v141-c-R010::phi::v141-c-R010-C004"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e30","v141-b-g02-e31","v141-b-g02-e32"],"rationale":"R010 records the day-ahead and expected intraday cost components of the same objective, and R008 is responsible for minimizing their total; the overall optimization and component accounting are not duplicate complete expressions and cannot be charged twice."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-L11","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R009","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R010","kind":"shared_node","from_refs":["v141-c-R009::V::execution.energy_trade"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R010::V::execution.energy_trade"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e09","v141-b-g02-e30","v141-b-g02-e31","v141-b-g02-e32"],"rationale":"Both chains reference the same execution function, and the source attaches the external electricity purchase cost and day-ahead feed-in compensation to the corresponding transactions; this does not turn all P2P execution content into external payment obligations."}],"annotation_policy":"Original D connections are annotations, not additional S edges.","empty_after_chain_suppression":false});
